#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""term-dojo — terminal mastery training (PLAN Phase 5).

Drills, quizzes, daily practice, progress tracking. Question content comes
from YOUR actual mappings: Neovim keymaps are dumped from the live config
(NvChad defaults + the config's own maps + myhost tweaks), tmux bindings are parsed from
this repo's tmux.conf. Herdr/shell/git banks mirror this repo's real setup
(see AGENTS.md layering).

Commands:
  term-dojo game [ch]    THE GAME: 9-chapter campaign, live-verified missions,
                         xp, belts. Premise: amnesia, but VSCode memory intact.
  term-dojo game reset   wipe game progress (quiz/tutor history stays)
  term-dojo              daily practice (10 questions, weakest topics first)
  term-dojo quiz [topic] quiz on one topic (or all)
  term-dojo drill [topic] hands-on drill instructions
  term-dojo tutor tmux|vim [N]  interactive tutorial: do it for real, verified live
  term-dojo topics       list topics and question counts
  term-dojo stats        progress per topic + streak
  term-dojo sync         rebuild question bank from live configs
  term-dojo cheatsheet   regenerate docs/cheatsheet.md from the bank

State: ~/.local/state/term-dojo/{bank.json,progress.json}
"""

